# [[ .Service.Name ]]

Helm chart scaffolded by `infragenie generate` from the Golden Path
**[[ .GoldenPath.Name ]]**. Conformant by construction — `infragenie review`
reports zero Golden Path findings against the rendered templates.

## Layout

| File | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `Chart.yaml` | Chart metadata |
| `values.yaml` | Image, replicas, service port |
| `templates/deployment.yaml` | Deployment + co-located NetworkPolicy (non-root, read-only rootfs, probes, resource limits, Prometheus annotations) |
| `templates/service.yaml` | ClusterIP Service |
| `Dockerfile` | Multi-stage, distroless, non-root |
| `.github/workflows/ci.yml` | CI: `helm lint` + the Golden Path's required steps |

## Render and install

```sh
helm lint .
helm template . | infragenie review --goldenpath ../../goldenpath.yml --diff -
helm install [[ .Service.Name ]] .
```

## What you still own

Application code, the `Dockerfile` build stage, real CI step commands (generated
steps are matcher placeholders), `TODO` label/annotation values, and ingress/egress
rules beyond default DNS egress.
